{"title": "Simplification (Level 1)", "duration_min": 20.0, "questions": [{"q_en": "<p>Solve the following expression :</p><p><div>&nbsp;80% of 520 - &radic;64 +&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">18 x 5</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">3</span></div>&nbsp;= ?&nbsp;</div></p><p></p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2306;&#2332;&#2325; &#2325;&#2379; &#2361;&#2354; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306; :</p><p><div>&nbsp;80% of 520 - &radic;64 +&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">18 x 5</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">3</span></div>&nbsp;= ?&nbsp;</div></p><p></p>", "options_en": ["408", "438", "428", "418"], "options_hi": ["408", "438", "428", "418"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>80% of 520 - &radic;64 + (18 * 5)/3 = ?</p><p>416  -  8 + 30 = ?</p><p>? = 438</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>80% of 520 - &radic;64 + (18 * 5)/3 = ?</p><p>416  -  8 + 30 = ?</p><p>? = 438</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p><div>&nbsp;Find the solution of&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">7</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">16</span></div>&nbsp;+&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">5</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">9</span></div>&nbsp;+&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">11</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">12</span></div></div></p><p></p>", "q_hi": "<p><div>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2379; &#2361;&#2354; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306; : <div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">7</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">16</span></div>&nbsp;+&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">5</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">9</span></div>&nbsp;+&nbsp;<div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">11</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">12</span></div></div></p><p></p>", "options_en": ["279/144", "273/144", "271/144", "275/144"], "options_hi": ["279/144", "273/144", "271/144", "275/144"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>L.C.M of 16, 9, and 12 = 144</p><p>7/16 = 63/144</p><p>5/9 = 80/144</p><p>11/12 = 132/144</p><p>The required sum = (63 + 80 + 132)/144 = 275/144 </p>", "solution_hi": "<p>L.C.M of 16, 9, and 12 = 144</p><p>7/16 = 63/144</p><p>5/9 = 80/144</p><p>11/12 = 132/144</p><p>The required sum = (63 + 80 + 132)/144 = 275/144 </p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>20% of 30&nbsp;+&nbsp;20% of&nbsp;45&nbsp;=</p>", "q_hi": "<p>30 &#2325;&#2366; 20% + 45 &#2325;&#2366; 20% =</p>", "options_en": ["18", "15", "10", "12"], "options_hi": ["18", "15", "10", "12"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>20% of 30&nbsp;+&nbsp;20% of&nbsp;45&nbsp;</p><p>=1/5 * 30 + 1/5 * 45</p><p>= 6 + 9</p><p>= 15</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>20% of 30&nbsp;+&nbsp;20% of&nbsp;45&nbsp;</p><p>=1/5 * 30 + 1/5 * 45</p><p>= 6 + 9</p><p>= 15</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>Simplify the following expression.</p><p>25 + 12  -  2 + [(4 &div;2)]</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2360;&#2350;&#2368;&#2325;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2379; &#2360;&#2352;&#2354;&#2368;&#2325;&#2371;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p><p>25 + 12 - 2 + [(4 &div;2)]</p>", "options_en": ["42", "37", "35", "44"], "options_hi": ["42", "37", "35", "44"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>25 + 12  -  2 + [(4 &div;2)]</p><p>As per BODMAS rule,</p><p>= 35 + [2] = 37</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>25 + 12  -  2 + [(4 &div;2)]</p><p>As per BODMAS rule,</p><p>= 35 + [2] = 37</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>What is the value of the following expression?</p><p>112  -  76 + 13 x 7  -  128 &div; 16  -  45 x 2 </p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2306;&#2332;&#2325; &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p><p>112 - 76 + 13 x 7 - 128 &div; 16 - 45 x 2</p>", "options_en": ["45", "29", "60", "20"], "options_hi": ["45", "29", "60", "20"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>We have:</p><p>112  -  76 + 13 x 7  -  128 &div; 16  -  45 x 2 </p><p>= 112  -  76 + 91  -  8  -  90</p><p>= 29</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>We have:</p><p>112  -  76 + 13 x 7  -  128 &div; 16  -  45 x 2 </p><p>= 112  -  76 + 91  -  8  -  90</p><p>= 29</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>Find the value of given expression.</p><p>64  -  [(104 &div; 13) + (648 &div; 12)  -  (906 &div; 151)]</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2306;&#2332;&#2325; &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p><p>64 - [(104 &div; 13) + (648 &div; 12) - (906 &div; 151)]</p>", "options_en": ["11", "5", "8", "13"], "options_hi": ["11", "5", "8", "13"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>64  -  [(104 &div; 13) + (648 &div; 12)  -  (906 &div; 151)]</p><p>= 64  -  [8 + 54  -  6]</p><p>= 64  -  56</p><p>= 8</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>64  -  [(104 &div; 13) + (648 &div; 12)  -  (906 &div; 151)]</p><p>= 64  -  [8 + 54  -  6]</p><p>= 64  -  56</p><p>= 8</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>The value of 1800 &div; 20 x {(12 -6) + (24 -12)} is:</p>", "q_hi": "<p>1800 &div; 20 x {(12 -6) + (24 -12)} &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2361;&#2376;:</p>", "options_en": ["1720", "1620", "840", "2720"], "options_hi": ["1720", "1620", "840", "2720"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p><img width=212 height=25 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p19398/image046.png\"></p><p><img width=96 height=23 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p19398/image047.png\"></p><p><img width=63 height=17 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p19398/image048.png\"></p><p><img width=49 height=17 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p19398/image049.pn