; padding: 0;\">2</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;\">_________</span><span style=\"display: block; padding: 0;border-top: thin solid black; text-align:center\">5</span></div>&nbsp;- 30% x 150 &div; 5 + 120&nbsp;</div></p><p></p>", "options_en": ["829", "929", "811", "911"], "options_hi": ["829", "929", "811", "911"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>= 2000 of 2/5  -  30% x 150 <img width=12 height=12 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p21924/image001.png\"> 5 + 120</p><p>= 800  -  30/100 x 150/5 + 120</p><p>= 800  -  9 + 120</p><p>= 920  -  9 = 911</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>= 2000 of 2/5  -  30% x 150 <img width=12 height=12 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p21924/image001.png\"> 5 + 120</p><p>= 800  -  30/100 x 150/5 + 120</p><p>= 800  -  9 + 120</p><p>= 920  -  9 = 911</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p>Simplify: [80% of 51.2 + 0.28 * 4  -  36 * 3.4 &div; 3.06  -  0.018 &div; 0.3 of 0.2]</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2360;&#2352;&#2354;&#2368;&#2325;&#2371;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;: [51.2 &#2325;&#2366; 80% + 0.28 * 4 - 36 * 3.4 &div; 3.06 - 0.018 &div; 0.2 &#2325;&#2366; 0.3]</p>", "options_en": ["2.24", "1.84", "1.78", "0.96"], "options_hi": ["2.24", "1.84", "1.78", "0.96"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>[80% of 51.2 + 0.28 * 4  -  36 * 3.4 &div; 3.06  -  0.018 &div; (0.3 of 0.2)]</p><p>= 40.96 + 1.12  -  40 - 0.3</p><p>= 1.78</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>[80% of 51.2 + 0.28 * 4  -  36 * 3.4 &div; 3.06  -  0.018 &div; (0.3 of 0.2)]</p><p>= 40.96 + 1.12  -  40 - 0.3</p><p>= 1.78</p>"}, {"q_en": "<p><div>&nbsp;The value of ( 120 &#247; <div style='display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;'><span style='text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;'>5</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;position: absolute; top: 0em; display: none;letter-spacing: -0.1em;'>_________</span><span style='display: block; padding: 0;border-top: 